 "descriptionHtml": "<div><div class=\"standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3\"><h2 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.375rem] font-bold\">Revive Longevity Restore \u2013 90 Vegetarian Capsules</h2></div></div><div><div class=\"standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3\"><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>Overview</strong><br>Revive Longevity Restore is a physician-formulated cellular wellness supplement centred on NAD+ support and healthy ageing. With 30 servings per bottle (three capsules once daily with food), it combines NMN, TMG, and a curated stack of polyphenols and longevity-associated compounds to support cellular repair, methylation balance, and overall cellular vitality. Note: this product was previously listed under the supplier shorthand \u201cRevive Restore\u201d \u2014 the correct public title is Revive Longevity Restore.</p></div></div><div><div class=\"standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3\">\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>Key Benefits</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\">\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">\n<strong>NMN (500 mg)</strong> \u2014 a direct NAD+ precursor to support cellular energy and repair pathways</li>\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">\n<strong>TMG / Trimethylglycine (500 mg)</strong> \u2014 supports methylation balance, an important cofactor when supplementing NMN</li>\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">\n<strong>Quercefit\u00ae (300 mg)</strong> \u2014 a highly bioavailable quercetin phytosome for antioxidant and cellular wellness support</li>\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">\n<strong>Pterostilbene (100 mg)</strong> \u2014 a potent polyphenol associated with healthy ageing and cellular protection</li>\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">\n<strong>Apigenin (50 mg)</strong> \u2014 a plant flavonoid associated with healthy ageing support</li>\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">\n<strong>L-Ergothioneine (25 mg)</strong> \u2014 a unique antioxidant amino acid found in longevity-associated dietary patterns</li>\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">\n<strong>Spermidine (10 mg)</strong> \u2014 supports autophagy and cellular renewal processes</li>\n</ul>\n</div></div><div><div class=\"standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3\"><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>Key Ingredients (per serving \u2013 3 capsules)</strong><br>NMN 500 mg | TMG 500 mg | Quercefit\u00ae 300 mg | Pterostilbene 100 mg | Apigenin 50 mg | L-Ergothioneine 25 mg | Spermidine 10 mg</p></div></div><div><div class=\"standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3\"><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>How to Use</strong><br>Take three capsules once daily with food. 30 servings per bottle. Consistent daily use is recommended for best results.</p></div></div><div><div class=\"standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3\"><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>Warnings</strong><br>Not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. Keep out of reach of children. Store in a cool, dry place. Consult a healthcare professional before use if you are pregnant, nursing, or taking medication.</p></div></div>",
